-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC # Testing and QA
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This lesson covers systematic approaches to validating migrated data and implementing testing frameworks. You will perform data parity checks between HMS and UC, leverage testing libraries for verification, and define quantitative governance rules using Delta constraints.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC <div style="border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; background: #fff3e0; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
