-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ## A. Data Validation Approaches
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Data validation is the essence of any migration. The idea is to compare resultant data in the UC environment, and ensure it matches that of the HMS environment prior to cutover.
